{"content":[{"c":["JONADAB"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. King David’s nephew, the son of David’s brother Shimeah. As a friend to David’s son Amnon, he devised a scheme by which Amnon seduced his half sister Tamar (",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.13.3-5","r":"2Sam.13.3-5","rawR":"2Sam.13.3-5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.13.3-5","value":"2Sam.13.3-5"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Sm 13:3-5"},"). Absalom, Tamar’s brother, sought revenge, eventually killing Amnon."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Recab’s son; descendant of the Kenites (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.2.55","r":"1Chr.2.55","rawR":"1Chr.2.55","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.2.55","value":"1Chr.2.55"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 2:55"},"; ",{"c":["nlt"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"}," “Jehonadab”). He founded the religious order of Recabites, who maintained a nomadic tradition. He encouraged Jehu in his bloody reform of the house of Ahab (",{"href":"?bref=2Kgs.10.15,23","r":"2Kgs.10.15,23","rawR":"2Kgs.10.15,23","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Kgs.10.15,23","value":"2Kgs.10.15,23"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Kgs 10:15, 23"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Jonadab","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"2 Sm 13:3-5","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Sam.13.3-5","rawQueryValue":"2Sam.13.3-5","sourceRefExact":"2Sam.13.3-5"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 2:55","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.2.55","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.2.55","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.2.55"},{"anchorText":"2 Kgs 10:15, 23","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Kgs.10.15,23","rawQueryValue":"2Kgs.10.15,23","sourceRefExact":"2Kgs.10.15,23"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"ae4aa049de47a8f47553b564d037414eaa968abcbe644697172f4a0da8dcab81","sourceItemName":"Jonadab","sourceItemOrder":299,"sourceMember":"Articles/J.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Jonadab","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Jonadab","title":"Jonadab","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}